+    ``state`` is the same view the finalize guard received — either a live
+    ``session.state`` dict (production, from ``ctx.session.state``) or a
+    ``State`` wrapper (unit tests). Both expose ``.get``.
+
+    Returns the stamp dict when it records a verdict for ``judge_kind``
+    (``"boundary"`` / ``"final"``), else ``None`` (missing, wrong judge, or a
+    malformed shape). The finalize guards cross-check a missing/unparsable
+    review slot against this stamp (issue #172): a stamp recording
+    ``passed=True`` means the judge ruled clean and the ``None`` review is a
+    state-prop failure, not a compliance verdict — scoring must proceed.
+    """
